<div class="wrap prose">
  <h1>Services</h1>
  <p>Every job we do is quoted, rostered, carried out, recorded and invoiced. The job record is how we get paid, so we keep it as carefully as we keep the machine.</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card"><img src="/assets/img/icon-fabrication.svg" alt="" width="56" height="56"><h2>Fabrication</h2><p>Steel and equipment repairs made to order: liners, guards, chutes, brackets and replacement parts, built in our Welshpool workshop or on site.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><img src="/assets/img/icon-fleet.svg" alt="" width="56" height="56"><h2>Fleet servicing</h2><p>Scheduled servicing of heavy equipment on your site, by a rostered crew, with the work logged against each machine.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><img src="/assets/img/icon-shutdown.svg" alt="" width="56" height="56"><h2>Shutdown crews</h2><p>Planned shutdowns run by our planning team: we take over a plant, work to the plan and hand it back on time.</p></article>
  </div>
  <h2>Where we work</h2>
  <p>Mid-sized and large mine operators in the Pilbara and the Goldfields of Western Australia. Our crews are based in Perth and at our remote site office, and fly in and out on rosters.</p>
